//! The `flex-basis` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property sets the
//! initial main size of a `flex item`. It sets the size of the content box unless otherwise set with
//! `box-sizing`.
//!
//! Initial: auto. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: refer to the flex container's inner main size.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - auto: Retrieves the value of the main size property as the used 'flex-basis'.
//! - content: Indicates automatic sizing, based on the flex item's content.
//! - fit-content: Use the fit-content inline size or fit-content block size, as appropriate to the
//! writing mode. See https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/width
//! - max-content: Use the max-content inline size or max-content block size, as appropriate to the
//! writing mode. See https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/width
//! - min-content: Use the min-content inline size or min-content block size, as appropriate to the
//! writing mode. See https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/width
//! - stretch: Sets the width of the element's [margin
//! box](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Core/Styling_basics/Box_model#parts_of_a_box)
//! to the width of its [containing
//! block](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Display/Containing_block#identifying_the_containing_block).
//! It attempts to make the margin box fill the available space in the containing block, so in a way
//! behaving similar to `100%` but applying the resulting size to the margin box rather than the box
//! determined by
//! [box-sizing](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/box-sizing).
//! See https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/width
//!
//! Grammar: content | <'width'>
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-flexbox-2/#propdef-flex-basis
//!
//! Author guide: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/flex-basis
//!
//! Purpose and value descriptions adapted from MDN contributors (CC-BY-SA-2.5).
//!
//! Additional value descriptions: Microsoft (MIT).
//!
//! Generated from @webref/css 8.7.8. Do not edit.

